 "10206": {
  "en": [
   "Who are you, come to make us forget our work!",
   "Who sends you in colorful dress—",
   "who is that thief of the world's heart!",
   "Hard stones in row after row",
   "stand guard at the cavern door,",
   "drowning them in streams of laughter",
   "you pour down a nectar-spring of delight!",
   "You are boatmen of the dream-boat,",
   "an intoxicating wind has touched the soul,",
   "the mad heart goes singing on.",
   "In what wanderer's garden",
   "did the flute sound moment after moment,",
   "making us forget that in the northeast corner",
   "the tempest gathers dark and dense."
