  "en": [
   "Have mercy, have mercy, Lord, again and again",
   "on this sinner of a hundred hundred offenses.",
   "You stay wakeful within me; for your grace",
   "my feeble heart raises obstacles without.",
   "Fear comes, shame comes, I die of weariness.",
   "Heaps of want devour me, perils close around.",
   "Drowsiness takes the tired body, it begs a bed in the dust—",
   "I start awake on the wrong path and drown in my tears."
