 "10210": {
  "en": [
   "Victory, victory, victory to you, O Radiant One—",
   "destroy, destroy the dense stain of delusion.",
   "Grant, grant your touch of fire,",
   "make pure my body, mind, and life—",
   "the shackles of bondage I cannot bear, cannot bear.",
   "Uproot every hidden obstacle.",
   "Throw open your door of nectar.",
   "We pilgrims beseech you, O Helmsman,",
   "carry us, carry us across the sea of sleep—",
   "let the hoard of dreams dissolve, dissolve."
