 "10211": {
  "en": [
   "Sound, O flute, sound.",
   "Fair one, adorn yourself with sandal garlands on this auspicious evening.",
   "Perhaps in honeyed Phalgun the restless wayfarer comes—",
   "has the champak, trembling under the bees' weight, not bloomed in the courtyard even today?",
   "A crimson veil on your head, kimshuk bracelets on your hands,",
   "anklets chiming at your feet, in the fragrance-laden breeze,",
   "reign in the paradise-grove murmurous with songs of praise."
