 "10212": {
  "en": [
   "I shall adorn you with care, with flowers and jewels,",
   "with armlets and bangles, with kumkum and sandal.",
   "Round your hair I shall wind a net of gold, at your throat hang a string of pearls,",
   "in your parted hair a crimson dot of sindur — I shall paint your feet with lac.",
   "I shall adorn my friend with her beloved's love, with the priceless gold of an unseen soul.",
   "I shall adorn her with the tender ache of parting, adorn her with the undying striving for union—",
   "of sweet shyness I shall fashion her array, in the bond of two souls' words."
