 "10213": {
  "en": [
   "Homage, homage, delighter of Shachi's heart, breaker of sorrow—",
   "lustrous as a fresh rain-cloud, deep-blue as kohl — homage, O homage, homage.",
   "In the shade of paradise walks, at your footfall, from new parijat blooms",
   "fragrance drifts through the honeyed night — homage, O homage, homage.",
   "To the rhythm of your glance, in Menaka's anklet-bells",
   "wakes a humming that shames the bees — homage, O homage, homage."
