 "10215": {
  "en": [
   "Flushed with the light of the hour's end, that day in Chaitra—",
   "in your eyes I saw my ruin.",
   "In this world's everyday play, in the daily fair of life,",
   "on roads and ghats a thousand people's laughter and jest—",
   "and in the midst of it, in your eyes, my ruin.",
   "A stir runs through the mango grove, the blossoms drop and fall—",
   "the scent known from all time rises and fills the air.",
   "On branch after blossoming branch, on wing after honeybee wing,",
   "moment by moment the spring day has heaved its sigh—",
   "and in the midst of it, in your eyes, my ruin.",
